@page
@{ ViewData["Title"] = L["Terms of Service"]; }
<div class="legal">
  <h1>@L["Terms of Service"]</h1>
  <p class="muted">@L["Draft — to be reviewed by Inticoo legal counsel before launch."]</p>
  <h2>1. Service</h2><p>Inticoo provides a cloud-based quality inspection platform on a subscription basis. Each customer company receives an independent account and database.</p>
  <h2>2. Subscription and billing</h2><p>Plans are billed monthly or annually in US dollars. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled before the next billing date. Fees already paid are non-refundable except where required by law or agreed in writing.</p>
  <h2>3. Customer data</h2><p>The customer owns its data. Inticoo processes it only to provide the service, keeps it separated from other customers and backs it up regularly.</p>
  <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2><p>You may not misuse the service, attempt to access other customers' data, or use it for unlawful purposes.</p>
  <h2>5. Contact</h2><p>info@inticoo.com</p>
</div>
